# Build output and machine-local configuration of the staff app's Gradle build. Source only
# is committed -- no binaries, no wrapper JAR, no keystore (the debug build signs with
# Gradle's own per-machine debug key, which lives under ~/.android, never here).
#
# scripts/redline-check.sh S2 fails if any file under these patterns is tracked anyway
# (`git add -f`): ripgrep honours this file and would never scan such a file.
/.gradle/
/.kotlin/
/build/
/app/build/
/local.properties
/captures/
*.iml
*.keystore
*.jks
